This repository contains configuration references and integration hooks for
third-party models and datasets. Those artifacts remain under their own terms:

- nvidia/OpenReasoning-Nemotron-7B: NVIDIA model card/license terms apply to
  weights and derived weights.
- OpenGVLab/InternViT-300M-448px-V2_5: the upstream model card/license terms
  apply to weights and derived weights.
- DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Base: its upstream model card/license terms apply to the
  reference architecture and any weights.
- Training datasets, benchmark datasets, and screenshot/handwriting sources
  must be used only under their respective licenses and access conditions.

The local files in `references/` are configuration snapshots, not copies of
third-party weights. Before redistribution, audit every dataset and model
artifact and preserve its required notices.

